{
  "version": 3,
  "name": "Teletronix LA-2A",
  "category": "Dynamics",
  "author": "LiveWDF",
  "description": "Teletronix C-10953 revision C with UTC A-10/A-24 transformers, 12AX7A/12BH7A signal stages and a valve-driven T4 attenuator. The dual-memory optical approximation models fast and program-dependent release. A 6V6 transport card represents the electrically related 6AQ5A; winding parameters are nominal and supplies regulated. The meter, stereo link and mains circuitry are omitted.",
